[00:21.56]1. The way of the truth is the best way of living,
[00:28.76]But no one can live your life for you.
[00:35.60]So take the advice that Jehovah is giving;
[00:42.58]Believe what he tells you is true.
[00:51.00](Chorus)
[00:51.00]Make the truth your own.
[00:56.38]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[01:03.04]And then feel the joy
[01:06.98]Jehovah gives you
[01:12.06]When you make the truth your own.
[01:30.50]2. The effort you make and the time you are spending
[01:37.62]In service to God and his Kingdom
[01:44.08]Will yield rich results and a life that’s unending,
[01:51.46]A life full of good things to come.
[01:59.86](Chorus)
[01:59.88]Make the truth your own.
[02:05.22]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[02:11.90]And then feel the joy
[02:15.84]Jehovah gives you
[02:20.78]When you make the truth your own.
[03:02.62]3. Compared with our God, we are all little children
[03:09.52]And need his direction and counsel.
[03:16.30]So walk ev’ry day with our Father in heaven;
[03:23.12]Receive his rich blessing in full.
[03:31.66](Chorus)
[03:31.66]Make the truth your own.
[03:36.98]Make it live, yes, make it real.
[03:43.78]And then feel the joy
[03:47.70]Jehovah gives you
[03:54.48]When you make the truth your own.
